  "versionNotes": [
    {
      "edition": "ASP.NET Core 10 and 11 / .NET 11 GA checked 2026-11-20",
      "items": [
        "ASP.NET Core 10 introduced built-in Minimal API validation support through Microsoft.Extensions.Validation and AddValidation. .NET 11 adds asynchronous DataAnnotations validation APIs, including AsyncValidationAttribute, IAsyncValidatableObject, Validator.ValidateObjectAsync, and asynchronous options validation; Minimal API validation uses the asynchronous path. ASP.NET Core 11 endpoint filters can observe supported parameter-check failures when configured, with ThrowOnBadRequest=false in Development. .NET 11 C# union types work with JSON request/response bodies, not route/query/header/form binding. ASP.NET Core 11's OpenAPI integration defaults to OpenAPI 3.2.0 (3.1.0 in .NET 10) and improves binary file response descriptions. WithOpenApi was deprecated in .NET 10; use document-wide or endpoint-specific operation transformers for customization."
      ],
